                "retweet_count": 24,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Republican budget bill is about to push Arizona hospitals and health care systems off a financial cliff.\n \nIt kills 70,000 construction & clean energy manufacturing jobs in our state.\n \nAnd it rips health care & nutrition assistance away from hundreds of thousands of our neighbors.\n \nArizona Republicans should listen to @GovernorHobbs. Put our state first and vote NO.",
